OL,3,GNEWSASome marine life can find storms
OL,4,A'devastating'
OL,5,
OL,6,FGuernsey's rocky coast could have
OL,7,Fhelped some marine life by providing
OL,8,Fholes to hide out the worst of Storm
OL,9,FAusten, where gusts reached 76mph
OL,10,F(122km/h), a marine scientist has said.
OL,12,FOceanongrapher Liz Sweet told BBC
OL,13,FGuernsey the conditions "can be
OL,14,Fdangerous, particularly with the big
OL,15,Fstorms" and said species such as crabs
OL,16,Fwould have found the mixing up of the
OL,17,Fsea and sediment challenging.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
