OL,3,GNEWSASome marine life can find storms
OL,4,A'devastating'
OL,5,
OL,6,FOctopuses may have fared better seeking
OL,7,Fshelter in holes and Sweet, who is also
OL,8,Fknown as the Guernsey Scientist,
OL,9,Fexplained that sharks and dolphins
OL,10,Fwould have swum out to calmer water.
OL,12,FShe added storms could be "really
OL,13,Fdevastating" for seal pups.
